OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cold night
OL,6,Fto come, with cloudy skies. Rain,
OL,7,Fperhaps with some sleet over hills at
OL,8,Ffirst and stronger winds move into the
OL,9,Ffar west of the region.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FWidespread rain through much
OL,12,Fof the day, particularly in the west,
OL,13,Fwith some gusty winds at first.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWet
OL,16,Fand windy on Saturday before clearing
OL,17,Fto the east by the evening. Winds
OL,18,Feasing into Sunday, where showers
OL,19,Ffollow and turning milder. Turning wet
OL,20,Fand windy again on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
